    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Let the Spark’s afterglow pass through you safely.</em></p><p>Once per <strong>Soma Break</strong>, when your party completes a <strong>Spark Step</strong>—stabilization, purification, negotiation, containment, or conversion—you may invoke Sapphire Conduction.</p><ul><li>Reduce an appropriate <strong>Darkness Track</strong> by <strong>1</strong>.</li><li>You reroll the lowest die on the first defense check or skill check related to Spark falloff or Spark backlash in the next 24 hours.</li></ul><p>You ground the metaphysical heat, leaving the region a touch brighter.</p>",
